  "description": "This is a UI library for WPF developers based on WPF custom advanced controls. Welcome to use..\n\nhow to use：\n\nStep 1: Add nuget;\n\nInstall-Package WPFDevelopers -Version 1.1.0.3-preview1\n\nStep 2: App.xaml Add the namespace:\n\nxmlns:wd=\"https://github.com/WPFDevelopersOrg/WPFDevelopers\"\n\nStep 3: Add nodes to App.xaml;\n\n      <Application.Resources>\n        <ResourceDictionary>\n            <ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>\n                <wd:Resources Theme=\"Light\" Color=\"Fuchsia\"/>\n            </ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>\n        </ResourceDictionary>\n    </Application.Resources>\n        \nStep 4: Add the namespace;\n\nxmlns:wd=\"https://github.com/WPFDevelopersOrg/WPFDevelopers\"\n\n加入QQ群：929469013 | 340500857 | 458041663",
